    "notes": "Two distinct audit-log contracts exist and must not be conflated: /api/v1/lifecycle/contracts/{contractId}/audit-log returns a paged envelope with userName/timestamp/actionType/fieldName/beforeText/afterText, while /api/v1/settings/audit-log returns entries with logDateTime/logUser/logAction/logEntity/details. The tracker GET must return 404 (not an empty body) when no routing exists, and POST .../negotiation/reviews must return 409 on a stale-version redline submission — the UI branches on exactly those status codes; enum values used are routingType Sequential|Parallel, negotiationStatus 'With Internal'|'With Counterparty'|'Agreed', version source Internal|External, libraryMatchStatus Standard|Deviated|Missing|Non-standard, and clause status 'AI-Suggested' gates the Accept control."
